  "question": {
    "text": "Dice <math><mi>A</mi></math> has <math><mn>4</mn></math> red and <math><mn>2</mn></math> white faces whereas dice <math><mi>B</mi></math> has <math><mn>3</mn></math> red and <math><mn>3</mn></math> white faces. A coin is tossed once, if it falls head then the game continues by throwing the dice <math><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and if it falls tail then the dice <math><mi>B</mi></math> is to be used. If red turns up at first <math><mn>3</mn></math> throws, then the probability that dice A is being used is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>37</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>64</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>91</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>41</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>27</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>35</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></math> Red turns up at first three throws<br /><math><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></math> Dice <math><mi>A</mi></math> is selected.&nbsp;<math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></math> Dice <math><mi>B</mi></math> is selected.&nbsp;<math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Using Bayes theorem, we get,<br /><math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>64</mn><mn>91</mn></mfrac></math>"
  }
